  "body": "URLSearchParams and URL interfaces are exposed to window and workers but they are not marked as  [serializable]. This means that it's not possible to pass them, as objects, to a worker or to a window using postMessage(), but only as strings.\r\nHaving them serializable (cloneable) would avoid the work-around of sending these objects as strings and recreating them. At the same time, this would allow to store these objects directly into IndexedDB.",
